These minimal fonts were generated from the former site's test fixture
builder. All glyph outlines are the same simple triangle. They contain no
third-party font designs and are provided under the project's CC0 dedication.

static.ttf: two characters A/B.
variable.ttf: three named weights (Light, Regular, Bold).
collection.ttc: two separately named members.
english.ttf: the characters in the English sample.
symbols.ttf: the characters in the unknown-language sample.
